sequenceDiagram
  participant U as 사용자
  participant M as MainActivity
  participant V as 음성 owner
  participant N as Route executor
  participant I as Snapshot IO lane
  participant R as RouteNavigator
  participant T as D02 TTS
  U->>V: F-D03-023 별도 길안내 시작
  V->>M: final and captured actor epoch decision token
  M->>M: P-D03-027 gates and request generation
  M->>N: immutable request and cancellable call
  M-->>V: F-D03-011 commandId bound to request generation
  N->>N: session recheck and HTTP parse P-D03-026
  N-->>M: validated route response
  M->>M: current lease and connected latest fix
  alt current and connected
    M->>I: F-D03-028 response token save first route then load check
    I->>I: process owner lock and first archive policy
    I-->>M: archive result
    M->>M: same response token and latest connected fix again
    alt still current
      M->>R: setRoute actual response
      M->>T: initial scope disclosure and current ACTION cue
      T-->>M: actual DONE
      M->>R: F-D03-032 acknowledge matching reserved cue
      M-->>V: work ended and output settling
    else context changed during IO
      M->>M: discard stale result
    end
  else stale disconnected or cancelled
    M->>M: reject install and preserve old route when applicable
  end
